Scope of this license

The MIT license above covers the code in this repository only (services/,
lib/, scripts/, examples/, test/, docs/).

The APK Web Lab runtime is NOT part of this repository. `npm run
fetch-runtime` downloads it, pinned by runtime.lock.json, from the public site
repository (https://github.com/madmax-dev-br/apk-browser-lab-site) into
vendor/apk-lab/. The downloaded files keep their own terms:

  * third-party components (AOSP framework and libcore, ICU, SQLite, zlib,
    tzdata, Skia/CanvasKit, Roboto and other fonts, Kotlin, Compose, ...) are
    under the licenses listed in vendor/apk-lab/THIRD_PARTY.md and in the
    LICENSE / NOTICE files next to each component (for example
    vendor/apk-lab/framework-aosp/, vendor/apk-lab/vendor/*/,
    vendor/apk-lab/licenses/);
  * the APK Web Lab runtime code itself is published by its author on that
    public site; use it under the terms its author publishes there.

The APKs you run with these services are yours or third parties'; their own
licenses and terms apply.
